        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, medium voltage, SBB, at grid
Transmission losses are taken from Itten, Frischknecht and Stucki (2014): LCI of Electricity Mixes and Grid.;
UUID: 27e791d7-abd8-399c-a405-41b994be6cc1
This dataset describes the transmission of the railway mix in Switzerland and includes the medium voltage network infrastructure, transmission losses and air pollutant emissions.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: GWh
Sampling: Statistics 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_27e791d7-abd8-399c-a405-41b994be6cc1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
